	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["53336232501835EE"]
			description: [
				"The cleanroom works, so welcome to HV. Crude oil stops being something you burn and turns into chemistry, and stainless steel goes into everything."
				"The way out is up: a rocket to the Moon."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_machine_hull"
			id: "3610F788A08B9FD3"
			rewards: [{ id: "097536B58AB1C2EC", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			shape: "rsquare"
			size: 1.5d
			tasks: [{ id: "652DBE317E40AFE7", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "HV Factory"
			x: 0.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3610F788A08B9FD3"]
			description: ["Another tier, another round of motors, pumps and arms, mostly in stainless steel this time. You'll be making these for the rest of the age, so an assembler that does nothing else isn't a bad idea."]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_electric_motor"
			id: "5B595A919C80BFC0"
			rewards: [{ id: "5B58F6733D9F1DB6", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1259BDC6AE103E3A", item: "gtceu:hv_electric_motor", type: "item" }
				{ id: "75481D84726D613B", item: "gtceu:hv_electric_piston", type: "item" }
				{ id: "23DA5CC1B81AD05C", item: "gtceu:hv_electric_pump", type: "item" }
				{ id: "5BC3088D093E5BCF", item: "gtceu:hv_robot_arm", type: "item" }
				{ id: "61D202ED6D17FF04", item: "gtceu:hv_conveyor_module", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "HV Components"
			x: 2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B595A919C80BFC0"]
			description: ["More bores per run than the MV drill, on every vein it knows. An HV hatch, stainless bits, drilling fluid. Earth and End ore, with the pickaxe retired. Bits and fluid by bus and pipe."]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_vein_drill"
			id: "721FA9268C278B3F"
			rewards: [{ id: "291D4CDF7933776F", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3FA479D4D0FB6DE4", item: "gtceu:hv_vein_drill", type: "item" }]
			title: "HV Vein Drill"
			x: 4.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["721FA9268C278B3F"]
			description: ["The HV drill's own bit, in stainless steel. If you run out, the old vanadium steel bit still fits, so the drill never has to sit idle."]
			icon: "grindless:stainless_steel_drill_bit"
			id: "2CD2C8EF5A408796"
			rewards: [{ id: "396C938D1616ED8E", type: "xp", xp: 25 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "4222DE23EA3992E8", item: "grindless:stainless_steel_drill_bit", type: "item" }]
			title: "Stainless Steel Drill Bit"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["756117B334515EA3", "2CD2C8EF5A408796"]
			description: ["Bring back raw ore from each End vein and make the samples at home, same as ever. The HV drill runs them with a stainless steel bit and drilling fluid in the tank, and platinum, palladium and zirconium come up with the rest."]
			icon: "grindless:vein_sample_sheldonite"
			id: "004525B795119B1B"
			rewards: [{ id: "6BC885CD026BAD65", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [
				{ id: "1AF75215B6DC9170", item: "grindless:vein_sample_bauxite_end", type: "item" }
				{ id: "6EAC9D6932581F0E", item: "grindless:vein_sample_magnetite_end", type: "item" }
				{ id: "456E0BD2E8DB3874", item: "grindless:vein_sample_sheldonite", type: "item" }
				{ id: "1DA53D76EFA29AB0", item: "grindless:vein_sample_zirconium", type: "item" }
			]
			title: "End Veins"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -4.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B595A919C80BFC0"]
			description: [
				"The greenhouse at HV size: more plants grown and harvested per run. Fertilizer and carbon dioxide. Plant stock for the chemistry ahead. Seeds in, harvest out, both by bus."
				"HV needs no more wood than MV: its carbon comes up as crude oil."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:hv_greenhouse"
			id: "3C06724477E3E0BB"
			rewards: [{ id: "35502C2CA21A059D", type: "xp", xp: 55 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5DB8D7813E63F2DC", item: "gtceu:hv_greenhouse", type: "item" }]
			title: "HV Greenhouse"
			x: 2.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5B595A919C80BFC0"]
			description: ["Every crude oil fraction in one pass, sulfur already removed. Crude oil, hydrogen, a programmed circuit for the job. Refining, hydrocracking and steam cracking. Crude in by pipe, a pipe out per fraction."]
			icon: "gtceu:refinery"
			id: "5C5D6FB9ECB7BC51"
			rewards: [{ id: "012A2C94D6BE9D69", type: "xp", xp: 90 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "659FBFC6A4539F6D", item: "gtceu:refinery", type: "item" }]
			title: "Refinery"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5C5D6FB9ECB7BC51"]
			description: [
				"Carbon monoxide and hydrogen from coal or heavy fuel and steam. Powdered coal or heavy fuel, steam. Easy hydrogen for the ammonia in rocket fuel. Each gas leaves by its own hatch."
				"The carbon monoxide is toxic: shift it or make methanol."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:syngas_plant"
			id: "4C18E0B7D5A92F61"
			rewards: [{ id: "47E2104B9F6D3A58", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "0E5A7C2D98B14F36", item: "gtceu:syngas_plant", type: "item" }]
			title: "Syngas Plant"
			x: 4.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4C18E0B7D5A92F61"]
			description: [
				"On circuit 4 the plant runs carbon monoxide and steam over the &6Shift Catalyst&r, and the poison comes out as carbon dioxide and more hydrogen. Send it to the refinery."
				"The catalyst is mixed from magnetite and chromium dust, and it wears out slowly."
			]
			icon: "grindless:shift_catalyst"
			id: "7B52A3F9E0C84D16"
			rewards: [{ id: "19B8F5D3A60E7C42", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1D4F16B0A2E73C85", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Water-Gas Shift"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5C5D6FB9ECB7BC51"]
			description: ["The refinery eats a &6Hydrotreating Catalyst&r every so often, so keep spares in its input bus. Cobalt comes from the nickel vein and molybdenum from the Nether, and the syngas plant's ash can stand in for the silica."]
			icon: "grindless:hydrotreating_catalyst"
			id: "64F01001238ACD74"
			rewards: [{ id: "7BB92FDB97461071", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "700AC5219F2F1ADB", item: "grindless:hydrotreating_catalyst", type: "item" }]
			title: "Hydrotreating Catalyst"
			x: 6.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64F01001238ACD74"]
			description: [
				"Put circuit 3 in the refinery, give it steam, and naphtha comes back as ethylene, propene, butadiene and benzene. Most of HV's plastics start there."
				"Circuit 2 cracks with hydrogen instead, which is handy for whatever fraction keeps piling up."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:refinery"
			id: "1051C4B8835DB4A3"
			rewards: [{ id: "40F96569A80405B1", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "5104D985778131A0", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Cracking and Olefins"
			x: 8.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["64F01001238ACD74"]
			description: [
				"Reforms naphtha into benzene, toluene and spare hydrogen. Naphtha and a reforming catalyst. More hydrogen for the refinery. Hydrogen pipes straight back to the refinery."
				"Optional: the electrolyzer covers hydrogen without it, with less to spare."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:reformer"
			id: "52781D6F5A69C4BE"
			optional: true
			rewards: [{ id: "46D2EE333DEFD840", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3D77A53BF29A83F5", item: "gtceu:reformer", type: "item" }]
			title: "Catalytic Reformer"
			x: 6.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["52781D6F5A69C4BE"]
			description: ["Platinum on silica, and the platinum comes from the End's sheldonite vein. That End sample in your drill finally earns its keep."]
			icon: "grindless:reforming_catalyst"
			id: "045FA73ADE3D0624"
			rewards: [{ id: "5669400C0C30D05F", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "0CAB2A5FCAE4C6DC", item: "grindless:reforming_catalyst", type: "item" }]
			title: "Reforming Catalyst"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1051C4B8835DB4A3"]
			description: ["Starts the PTFE line: &6methane&r split out of refinery gas. Refinery gas from the rig, and a distillery. Chloroform, the next step. Pipe the gas in and pipe the methane to the chlorination reactor."]
			icon: "gtceu:methane_bucket"
			id: "582DF5B1C59991CC"
			rewards: [{ id: "3ACDD1A2E278D2BC", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "331B93FEF330E022", item: "gtceu:methane_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Methane"
			x: 10.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["582DF5B1C59991CC"]
			description: ["Chlorinates methane into &6chloroform&r, the carbon skeleton of the fluorinated gases. Methane, chlorine and a chemical reactor. R22, and the hydrochloric acid that comes with it. Chlorine and methane by pipe, chloroform out to the next reactor."]
			icon: "gtceu:chloroform_bucket"
			id: "1BF99B853FC2FAB6"
			rewards: [{ id: "19E4EC97F5A38F2E", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7458CF06E2C0F3D5", item: "gtceu:chloroform_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Chloroform"
			x: 12.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1BF99B853FC2FAB6"]
			description: ["Swaps chlorine for fluorine: &6R22&r is chloroform with two fluorines. Chloroform and hydrofluoric acid, from topaz, lepidolite or bastnasite fluorine. TFE through pyrolysis. Chloroform alone no longer gets there. Acid and chloroform by pipe. The spent hydrochloric acid goes to vinyl chloride."]
			icon: "gtceu:chlorodifluoromethane_bucket"
			id: "1673B5255C135DB2"
			rewards: [{ id: "1AD730EB05424D8E", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "10DCD6D1B460466D", item: "gtceu:chlorodifluoromethane_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "R22"
			x: 14.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1673B5255C135DB2"]
			description: ["Cracks R22 hot to join two carbons: &6tetrafluoroethylene&r, the monomer. R22 and a chemical reactor with a strong power feed. PTFE, and with it the large chemical reactor. R22 in by pipe, TFE straight on to the polymer reactor, acid to storage."]
			icon: "gtceu:tetrafluoroethylene_bucket"
			id: "33C25D2A6AB82F6B"
			rewards: [{ id: "13E2E931A80B1F98", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "584D935239AC2F41", item: "gtceu:tetrafluoroethylene_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "TFE Pyrolysis"
			x: 16.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["33C25D2A6AB82F6B"]
			description: ["Polymerizes TFE into &6PTFE&r, the plastic nothing eats. TFE and the polymer reactor. The large chemical reactor is lined with the result. Inert casings, PTFE pipes and the large chemical reactor. TFE by pipe, PTFE out by bus to the casing assembler."]
			icon: "gtceu:inert_machine_casing"
			id: "720331A06D7F2344"
			rewards: [{ id: "2BA86A8E9940CABD", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ count: 8L, id: "2B26A5F014E45D2A", item: "gtceu:inert_machine_casing", type: "item" }]
			title: "PTFE"
			x: 18.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["720331A06D7F2344"]
			description: [
				"With PTFE walls, the &6Large Chemical Reactor&r can finally be built. Its big job in HV is gasoline, and the methanol and acetone piling up since MV go straight into it."
				"Gasoline is also a far better fuel than creosote."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:large_chemical_reactor"
			id: "35719B747A75F7B6"
			rewards: [{ id: "3EB45CE14A466656", type: "xp", xp: 55 }]
			tasks: [{ id: "1E56A8818DE368EE", item: "gtceu:large_chemical_reactor", type: "item" }]
			title: "Gasoline"
			x: 20.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1051C4B8835DB4A3"]
			description: ["Starts the epoxy line: benzene and propene joined into &6cumene&r. Benzene from cracking or the reformer, propene, and phosphoric acid as catalyst. Phenol. The shortcuts to it are gone. Benzene and propene by pipe, with the acid recycled back into the reactor."]
			icon: "gtceu:cumene_bucket"
			id: "1443E68287DB00C2"
			rewards: [{ id: "368D1B2B97701AF2", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "78D67D6D740B61AD", item: "gtceu:cumene_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Cumene"
			x: 8.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1443E68287DB00C2"]
			description: ["Oxidizes cumene and splits it into &6phenol&r and acetone in one go. Cumene and oxygen in a chemical reactor. Bisphenol A. The acetone feeds gasoline as well. Oxygen from the air line, phenol to the next reactor, acetone to the tank."]
			icon: "gtceu:phenol_bucket"
			id: "72C998E20F696595"
			rewards: [{ id: "5786616CDF7F4527", type: "xp", xp: 30 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "5595FB73AA2AAC16", item: "gtceu:phenol_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Phenol and Acetone"
			x: 10.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["72C998E20F696595"]
			description: ["Condenses phenol with acetone under acid into &6bisphenol A&r, the epoxy backbone. Phenol, acetone and hydrochloric acid. Epoxy resin. Phenol and acetone share one pipe loop; the acid comes back from PTFE's chain."]
			icon: "gtceu:bisphenol_a_bucket"
			id: "78AD7D19F7D9606C"
			rewards: [{ id: "5BDAA9D258F10623", type: "xp", xp: 35 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "7EB44CC45BDB37B4", item: "gtceu:bisphenol_a_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Bisphenol A"
			x: 12.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["78AD7D19F7D9606C"]
			description: ["Closes the ring with epichlorohydrin and caustic soda: &6epoxy&r resin. Bisphenol A, epichlorohydrin and sodium hydroxide. The composite autoclave and everything cured in it. Resin by pipe straight into the autoclave's hatch."]
			icon: "gtceu:epoxy_bucket"
			id: "52FEF259028A446A"
			rewards: [{ id: "54FE3099438475C8", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			shape: "hexagon"
			size: 1.0d
			tasks: [{ id: "1EFABA8FD8A32B64", item: "gtceu:epoxy_bucket", type: "item" }]
			title: "Epoxy"
			x: 14.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["52FEF259028A446A"]
			description: ["Cures fiber in epoxy under nitrogen pressure. Fiber, epoxy and nitrogen through the hatches. Heat-shield tiles and overwrapped tanks. Everything arrives by hatch; leave the inside empty."]
			icon: "gtceu:composite_autoclave"
			id: "3B7E2C9A41D06F85"
			rewards: [{ id: "2A3D5F1E07C4B926", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "5A0C81E7D2B94F16", item: "gtceu:composite_autoclave", type: "item" }]
			title: "Composite Autoclave"
			x: 16.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["3B7E2C9A41D06F85"]
			description: ["&6Ablative Heat-Shield Tiles&r are fiberglass soaked in epoxy and cured under nitrogen. They sit at the base of each motor and burn away so the motor doesn't."]
			icon: "grindless:ablative_heat_shield_tile"
			id: "6D0A4F18B2E93C57"
			rewards: [{ id: "2C6E9B0F4D17A853", type: "xp", xp: 45 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 2L, id: "1C7E09A3F5D82B64", item: "grindless:ablative_heat_shield_tile", type: "item" }]
			title: "Heat-Shield Tiles"
			x: 18.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["471A024EBFCA8459", "3B7E2C9A41D06F85"]
			description: ["An &6Overwrapped Tank&r is a stainless steel drum wrapped in para-aramid and cured in epoxy, light and very hard to burst. The rocket's fuel tanks are built around them."]
			icon: "grindless:composite_overwrapped_tank"
			id: "1F8C57E2A6D40B93"
			rewards: [{ id: "7F1A4D82B0E6C395", type: "xp", xp: 45 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 4L, id: "4E2B9D06C1A7F358", item: "grindless:composite_overwrapped_tank", type: "item" }]
			title: "Overwrapped Tanks"
			x: 18.0d
			y: -3.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["6D0A4F18B2E93C57"]
			description: ["The &6Untested Rocket Motor&r is where the qualified thrusters and heat-shield tiles come together, on a stainless steel frame. The name is honest."]
			icon: "grindless:untested_rocket_motor"
			id: "5E26B9D13A7C08F4"
			rewards: [{ id: "305E3C97D2A18F64", type: "xp", xp: 50 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "3F90C2E8B1D5A746", item: "grindless:untested_rocket_motor", type: "item" }]
			title: "Untested Rocket Motor"
			x: 20.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["5E26B9D13A7C08F4", "76D281E9D9C6FD20", "115744A9113F8B38"]
			description: [
				"Back to the &6Engine Test Stand&r from MV, this time with a whole motor, burning the same rocket fuel it'll fly on. It needs HV power now: an HV energy hatch, or a second MV one."
				"The motors always pass, but it's nice to know before you're sitting on top of one."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:engine_test_stand"
			id: "2A94D7C0E6B15F38"
			rewards: [{ id: "4D9A6E2C81F0B375", type: "xp", xp: 60 }]
			shape: "gear"
			size: 1.25d
			tasks: [{ id: "6B1D3E7A90C24F5D", type: "checkmark" }]
			title: "Static Fire"
			x: 24.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2A94D7C0E6B15F38"]
			description: [
				"Each static fire hands you a &6Basic Rocket Motor&r. Make more than the bare minimum: every block of the rocket has weight, and with too few motors it barely leaves the pad."
				"The rocket's screen shows its speed."
			]
			icon: "gcyr:basic_rocket_motor"
			id: "5C1D3FB96A9FB74A"
			rewards: [{ id: "71613751FE3583C9", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 6L, id: "6C0A50CC41916AEE", item: "gcyr:basic_rocket_motor", type: "item" }]
			title: "Rocket Motors"
			x: 26.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1F8C57E2A6D40B93"]
			description: ["A single &6Basic Fuel Tank&r can't hold enough for a Moon launch, so the first rocket carries a pair."]
			icon: "gcyr:basic_fuel_tank"
			id: "4A6E81ABD8026025"
			rewards: [{ id: "240589002FC5DF78", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
			tasks: [{ count: 2L, id: "216EB77B2A3105FF", item: "gcyr:basic_fuel_tank", type: "item" }]
			title: "Fuel Tanks"
			x: 24.0d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["35719B747A75F7B6"]
			description: [
				"&6Rocket Fuel&r is Aerozine 50 mixed with dinitrogen tetroxide. The Aerozine is hydrazine from the chemical plant plus UDMH from dimethylamine and monochloramine, and the plant must be built with HV machine casings."
				"A Moon launch needs at least 8 buckets in the tanks. Make extra, because every static fire burns some too."
			]
			icon: "gtceu:rocket_fuel_bucket"
			id: "76D281E9D9C6FD20"
			rewards: [{ id: "3E3E25931D1CA960", type: "xp", xp: 40 }]
