			description: ["Monochloramine and dimethylamine react by the Raschig route into &6unsymmetrical dimethylhydrazine&r. The old methanol shortcut is gone. Both feeds in a large chemical reactor at 480 EU/t. Aerozine 50. The hydrochloric acid goes to PVC and epoxy. Both feeds by pipe, UDMH on to the mixer, the acid into the PVC loop."]
