			description: ["A &6platinum-rhodium gauze&r is the catalyst for burning ammonia into nitric acid. Nitric acid no longer comes from the elements. Platinum and rhodium foil in an assembler, then the large chemical reactor with ammonia and oxygen. Nitric acid for explosives, nitrates and what follows. Ammonia and oxygen by pipe. Replace the gauze as it wears."]
