		{
			dependencies: ["5B0BC2B3A7F3AF29"]
			description: ["The &6Multi Smelter&r cooks a whole stack of ingots at once, and alloys them too. Its controller, which takes a furnace, HV circuits and copper cable, and cupronickel coils. Bronze, brass and cupronickel by the stack, with no row of furnaces. Ingots in by bus, alloys out by bus."]
