		{
			dependencies: ["7D927987A382CC50"]
			description: ["Some gems only form under a blast. The &6Implosion Compressor&r does it behind steel walls, and you stand clear. Its controller, with obsidian, HV circuits and gold cable, and explosives to feed it. Ender pearls and gems, made on purpose. Gems in and explosives in by bus, results out by bus."]
			icon: "gtceu:implosion_compressor"
			id: "35FED9571A6D4E05"
