		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7D927987A382CC50"]
			description: ["Long hydrocarbons break into short ones inside the &6Cracker&r, with hydrogen or steam to help. Its controller, with cupronickel coils, an HV pump and HV circuits. Lighter oil products for plastics and fuels, and a base for the big cracking hall later. Oil and hydrogen in by hatch, cracked fluids out by hatch."]
			icon: "gtceu:cracker"
			id: "7C935662035B9FC6"
