		}
		{
			dependencies: ["7C935662035B9FC6"]
			description: ["The &6Distillation Tower&r splits oil into its fractions, one output hatch per layer. Its controller, with EV circuits, a stainless fluid pipe and an HV pump. Light fuel, propene, lubricant and the parts of the large distillery and the heavy-water plant. Fluid in by hatch, each fraction out by its own hatch."]
			icon: "gtceu:distillation_tower"
