		{
			dependencies: ["7C935662035B9FC6"]
			description: ["The &6Steel Large Boiler&r burns solid fuel into steam for every turbine that follows. Its controller, with a steel firebox casing, HV circuits and copper cable. Steam at the scale a turbine hall wants, before the titanium boiler. Fuel in by bus, water in by hatch, steam out by hatch."]
